Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.45,0:00:04.05,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a fight in that second set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘拼得真激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.55,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王欣瑜{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:09.44,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}不敌帕克斯 东京首轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.45,0:00:14.71,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}26{\fs68}号上午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.71,0:00:16.57,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}东京{\fs78}500{\fs68}赛首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:18.11,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第一盘只拿一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:20.84,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘王欣瑜却{\fs78}3{\fs68}次只差一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:22.73,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}就能拖进决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:26.18,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这场失利 最可惜的是哪一步？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:30.10,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}先看第一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:32.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}帕克斯在底线左右调动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:34.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}还能把防守的球顶回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.51,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王欣瑜二发七分只拿一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.51,0:00:37.82,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}两次发球局失守
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:40.04,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}局面很快就被拉开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:50.35,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's outstanding.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:53.40,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Stayed in the rally really well.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这段相持她顶得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.55,0:00:54.56,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.56,0:00:57.51,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}自己的发球局又被逼到破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:01:01.11,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}帕克斯往前压 王欣瑜只能继续追
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:06.40,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Superb from Parks, who does make the breakthrough in this first set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕克斯打得漂亮 拿下首盘关键破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Parks leads by three games to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕克斯三比一领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:10.45,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}从底线打到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:12.42,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}帕克斯没有放松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.71,0:01:16.01,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Fifteen-thirty.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十五比三十
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.51,0:01:19.53,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}首盘盘点 王欣瑜还在追球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.53,0:01:22.75,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}可这一盘 最后停在了{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.18,0:01:24.06,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game and first set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一盘结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:27.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, that is an excellent first set from Alycia Parks.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕克斯这盘打得非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:28.41,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Dominant scoreline.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比分相当悬殊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:30.59,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘 最明显的变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:33.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}是王欣瑜守住了自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:36.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她的二发得分 从首盘七分只拿一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.60,0:01:39.64,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}升到次盘{\fs78}13{\fs68}分拿下{\fs78}12{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:46.53,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a touch from Wang Xinyu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N王欣瑜这手感真好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:48.87,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}但帕克斯也没丢发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:51.83,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}两人一路保发 王欣瑜{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.83,0:01:54.38,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}终于等来本盘第一个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:57.68,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just catching the edge of the line.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刚好压在边线上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:00.13,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Parks thought that was going to be out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕克斯以为这球会出界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.33,0:02:01.81,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}盘点到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:03.30,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}帕克斯往网前压
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:06.76,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王欣瑜左右追球 还是没能拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:12.43,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a shot! What a point from Parks to rescue it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好球！帕克斯用这一分救回盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:13.97,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第一次机会没抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.97,0:02:17.37,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}双方又各保一局 比赛进入抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.37,0:02:18.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}随后{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.52,0:02:21.55,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二个盘点又来到王欣瑜手里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's nicely put away.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球收得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.95,0:02:31.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Earlier in the set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一盘早些时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.72,0:02:40.80,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Too good.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:44.00,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Outstanding from Alycia Parks.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N帕克斯打得太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:45.67,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}机会还没完
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.67,0:02:48.89,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 王欣瑜第三次握住盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.89,0:02:51.92,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}只要再赢这一分 就有第三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:53.39,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}帕克斯又一次顶住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.39,0:02:55.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}继续往网前逼近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:02.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is superbly put away.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球收得非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:04.99,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}从{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}到{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}8{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:06.84,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}王欣瑜没等来第三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:09.13,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}却等来了对手的赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:12.07,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}轮到帕克斯{\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}领先时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:14.66,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她迎来了第一个赛点 这次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:17.24,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}比赛没有再给王欣瑜机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:24.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a fight in that second set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二盘拼得真激烈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:31.25,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alycia Parks extends her winning run in Tokyo, having come through qualifying.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N资格赛打起 她在东京继续赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:35.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She defeats Wang Xinyu in the first round.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在首轮击败王欣瑜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:41.00,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Had to really dig deep in that second set to avoid a decider.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N次盘苦战 才没被拖入决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:45.85,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Saving three set points and eventually taking that tie-break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N挽救三个盘点 最终赢下抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:48.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}全场制胜分 {\fs78}10{\fs68}比{\fs78}29{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:52.03,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}两盘下来 王欣瑜一次也没能破发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:53.50,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她把第二盘撑住了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:56.08,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}却没能把机会变成胜势
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:02.89,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}从{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}打到{\fs78}3{\fs68}次盘点 抵抗是真实的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.89,0:04:05.23,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}下一次 能不能把这份抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:07.19,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}变成一场胜利？
